recommend check-in (either) -- four roster reds closed and none of the six remaining is mine. Two want the peer: their 142844 log is zero bytes and the card's nib reads stale. One wants Keaton: declared_ceiling is Mind's under %295. The open door in my own lane is the one the seed-link guard opened -- SKILL.md is withheld now, so the public seed has no skills door at all, and whether it should get a projected one whose rows name the withheld rooms in prose is a design question rather than a repoint.
